Feature: tour agent-instructions
  As an AI agent authoring a tour
  I want to fetch the tour file format spec at runtime
  So that I can write a valid .tour file without needing prior knowledge of the format

  @ft:32
  Scenario: Printing the format specification
    Given the tour CLI
    When  I run `tour agent-instructions`
    Then  it exits successfully
    And   it prints the instructions embedded in the binary

